     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div>What about </div><div><br></div><div><div>ldf = split(df, df$shape)</div><div>pl &lt;- lapply(ldf, function(x) Polygon(x[,1:2]))</div><div>Ppl &lt;- lapply(1:length(pl), function(i) Polygons(list(pl[[i]]), names(pl)[i]))</div><div>spl &lt;- SpatialPolygons(Ppl)</div><div>plot(spl)</div></div><div><br></div><div>regards</div><div>Christiaan</div><br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div>"
